From: Yang YiHe <108562510+nmhjklnm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 05:07:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: forward native blocking Stop hook responses as notices

Why: decision/reason-only Stop command hooks continue the model without an informational frame. Enable native hook lifecycle events and present the successful blocking response through the existing notice lane, without duplicating systemMessage output or inferring boundaries from assistant prose.

Upstream: none yet.

Drop when: upstream enables and forwards decision/reason-only blocking Stop responses through ACP notices.
